So today I'm going to talk about how I
use my self-hosted n8n, why I decided

00:00:16.487 --> 00:00:21.820
to do such a setup and also some advantages
I'll show you, I'll guide you quickly

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:27.167
through my own system, I'll do a very
